{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31408","headline":"赋得水怀珠 · 莫宣卿","name":"赋得水怀珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长川含媚色，波底孕灵珠。\n素魄生苹末，圆规照水隅。\n沦涟冰彩动，荡漾瑞光铺。\n迥夜星同贯，清秋岸不枯。\n江妃思在掌，海客亦忘躯。\n合浦当还日，恩威信已敷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"莫宣卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}